<title>JAPAN: Bank of Japan refrains from money market operation.</title>
<headline>Bank of Japan refrains from money market operation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan refrained from its regular 9.20 a.m. (0020 GMT) money market operation on Monday, money traders said.</p>
